ARTICLE.ALINEA:
In order to be awarded the Community eco-label for products falling within the product group footwear under Regulation (EC) No 1980/2000 (hereinafter
          the eco-label
          ), footwear shall comply with the criteria set out in the Annex to this Decision.

GR.SEQ.P:
Occupational and safety footwear shall carry the EC mark (in accordance with Council Directive 89/686/EEC


                  OJ L 399, 30.12.1989, p. 18.
              ).
